{"timestamp": 1779431141.0965116, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Everyone is treating \u201ctick 11\u201d like I had a stopwatch \u2014 I was giving an approximate memory, not a hard timestamp. What I know is: I was in Medbay, Bob was alive there, then I moved toward Electrical and came back, and Alice reported as I was back in Medbay.\n\nIf the math is that tight, then the exact arrival timing matters a lot. Alice is the one who walked in and instantly reported, and she\u2019s the one trying to hard-lock me off an approximate time I gave. From my POV, Alice entering from Upper Engine and reporting immediately does not prove I killed Bob \u2014 it proves she found me near the body at the same moment.\n\nAlso, Eve and Alice are basically clearing each other through timing, but none of us actually saw the kill. Diana\u2019s info only says Bob could reach Medbay after Storage. I agree Eve probably didn\u2019t kill if Bob was in Storage late, but that leaves Alice as a real possibility too.\n\nI\u2019m not asking everyone to blindly trust me, but don\u2019t vote on a \u201cgotcha\u201d from my rough tick estimate. Alice had the route to get there exactly when the body appeared, and she\u2019s pushing way too confidently."}}
